# C++ compiled application - full project (code + testing + build + tooling + release + CI).
# A thin app/ binary over an internal core library in src/, with no public API: nothing
# outside the repo links it, so there is no include/ and no alias. Ships a binary, so it
# keeps the functional test layer and the Docker release matrix. Use cpp-lib when there is
# no binary to ship, cpp-lib-cli when the core is also a reusable library behind include/.
